Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 08:55:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] VideoPlayer, filesystem: the license header of the files
 added for soft telecine and readdir() names Hades

Mpeg2SoftTelecine.h, DiscSoftTelecine.h, DiscSoftTelecineScan.cpp and .h,
FilmTimer.h, RepeatedField.h and DirEntry.h were written for Hades and are not
in Kodi, but their license header said "Copyright (C) 2026 Team Kodi" and
"This file is part of Kodi". They now say what the other files that Hades
added to Kodi say: "Copyright (C) 2026 Hades" and "This file is part of
LibreELEC Hades. It is not in Kodi as Team Kodi publishes it." The SPDX line
(GPL-2.0-or-later) is unchanged.

t_headers.sh (every file added since the base of this version in these
folders has that header) fails before, with these seven, and passes after.
---
